      "sensory-visual-pathway",
      "sensory-lateral-geniculate-nucleus"
    ],
    "engineering_link": "神经节细胞的稀疏与瞬变响应提示了事件相机（event camera）的编码方式。",
    "references": [
      {
        "type": "textbook",
